[Options]

[A.]
<h2>Win the fight!</h2>
<i>"Nothing is stronger then friendship"<br>
--Sayains </i>  

<p>While you were reunited with your newly-promoted friend Luitenant Martin, it seemed that the previous two attacks by the "pirates" weren't "pirate attacks" but it's a guild who wants to get rid of DDC: The Razorians. They are as you've noticed pretty good. You and Martin were send out to destroy more of the Razorians, but you came in a fight with 2 pirate islands and as much Razorian islands.

<p>Your mission is to eliminate all enemy threats, especially the Razorians.

$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Play Mission,DoNothing,0

[BadTeamDead]
<h2>Nice battle!</h2>
<p>
We have won a pretty hard fight against all those islands! Well done!

<$Config,Done{mission.filename}=1>
$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,0
$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,Razorianwar4

[ai2PriestDead]
<p>~[IwindBalloon.D1]<br>
<h2>A message by air ship</h2>
<p>Good fighting, my friend. Pirate Kahrooza has been slain!

[ai3PriestDead]
<p>~[IwindBalloon.D1]<br>
<h2>A message by air ship</h2>
<p>The white pirate is killed! Excellent!

[ai4PriestDead]
<h2>Luitenant Martin is slain</h2>
<p>Luitenant Martin has been defeated! DDC will not be happy about this!

$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain

[ai5PriestDead]
<p>~[IwindBalloon.D1]<br>
<h2>A message by air ship</h2>
<p>We have defeated Lord Dodadude! Hurray!

[ai6PriestDead]
<p>~[IwindBalloon.D1]<br>
<h2>A message by air ship</h2>
<p>Nice one! Lord Gildo is history!

[Failed]
<h2>Failure!</h2>
<p>
You are dead! The Razorians have prevailed!

$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain

[END]